Make;folder;r;classes;class;root;yml;p;f;t;i;e;expected;present;stale;mdf;DocsRoot
⍝ Generate Class documentation

root←{⊃⎕NPARTS ¯1↓⍵}⍣3⊢4⊃5179⌶⊃⎕SI
:If 0=≢root                      ⍝ no source path (headless/CI) → use current directory
    root←⊃1 ⎕NPARTS 'x'
:EndIf
folder←root,'docs/ObjectRef'

⍝ Locate the object-reference doc source (sibling checkout) so AddDocLink only
⍝ links names that have a Dyalog page; if it is absent, all names are linked
DocsRoot←(⊃⎕NPARTS ¯1↓root),'documentation/object-reference/docs/'
:If ~⎕NEXISTS DocsRoot
    ⎕←'Note: doc source not found at ',DocsRoot,' — linking all names'
    DocsRoot←''
:EndIf

r←'# Classes' '',,Classes
r Put folder,'/Classes.md'

classes←##.classes.(⍎¨⎕NL -9).ClassName

:For class :In classes
   r←('# ',class) '',,Details class
   r Put folder,'/',class,'.md'
:EndFor

⍝ Prune docs for classes that no longer exist (orphans left by removals)
expected←(⊂'Classes.md'),classes,¨⊂'.md'
present←{(2⊃mdf),3⊃mdf←⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨⊃(⎕NINFO⍠1)folder,'/*.md'
:For stale :In (present~expected)
    ⎕←'Deleting ',folder,'/',stale
    ⎕NDELETE folder,'/',stale
:EndFor

yml←⊃⎕NGET (f←root,'mkdocs.yml') 1
:If (≢yml)≥p←yml⍳⊂'  - Supported Features:'
    t←p↑yml
    i←((↑p↓yml)∧.=' ')⍳1
    e←(¯1+p+i)↓yml
    (t,('    - ObjectRef/'∘,¨(⊂'Classes.md'),classes,¨⊂'.md'),e) Put f
:Else
    ⎕←'Unable to update ',f,': Supported Features section not found'
:EndIf
